  boothLines:
  - Hi. Night shift, ICU. Can we make this quick?
  lineIfApproved: Thank you. If you ever end up in the ICU, ask for me. ...Don't
    end up in the ICU.
  lineIfRejected: The plates? The guy who sold me the car said his cousin at the
    DMV handled it. Of course he did. ...I'll call in. The ER is already short.
  lineIfImprisoned: For a PLATE? I have a man on a ventilator waiting for me!
